+## 6. Cost
+
+Stripped `build/kolmo`: 3,537,672 (branch with codec 32) -> 3,549,960 bytes (+12,288); against rc3: +49,152. Text
+segment 3,520,253 -> 3,532,301. rc3's KLZ encoder is kept only so that id 28 stays writable on request and its
+bytes stay pinned by a test; dropping it would return part of this.
+
+## 7. Not done, not verified
+
+- The lane's own benchmark set (19 files with enwik8 and the structured files) was not re-run; its tables stand as
+  the lane's record for the coder now called KLZS.
+- `make check`, `make check-rc`, `make check-sanitizers` as a whole (the lane records them as passing on its own
