+**KLZS (codec 31, wave 4, landed by review40):** the wave-4 LZ lane's byte-aligned stream format takes the LZ4 role
+under `KOLMO_NATIVE=lz` in place of KLZ (codec 28). Codec 28 keeps the format rc3 wrote and keeps decoding; it is no
+longer chosen. The lane's KLZH parse (one table at level 1, the second recent offset after each match) is shared by
+codecs 29 and 32: same formats, other bytes than rc3 under the opt-in. Compatibility proof and measurements:
+`benchmark/review40/w4-compat/RESULTS.md`; the lane's own record: `benchmark/w4/lz/RESULTS.md` with its errata file.
+
